  "content": "<p>\n    <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/refs/heads/dev/images/logo.png\">\n</p><p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fflightassistant\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/available/modrinth_vector.svg\" alt=\"可在 Modrinth 获取\"></a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252ffabric-api%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/requires/fabric-api_vector.svg\" alt=\"需要 Fabric API\"></a>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fflightassistant%252fversions%253fl%253dforge%2526l%253dneoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/supported/forge_vector.svg\" alt=\"支持 Forge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/5kcBCvnbTp\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\" alt=\"在 Discord 上与我们交流\"></a>\n</p><hr><p><strong>FlightAssistant</strong> 是一款功能强大的客户端模组，为 Minecraft 的鞘翅飞行添加了完全可配置的完整航空电子设备、态势感知工具和高级自动化功能，同时对休闲玩家也十分友好。</p><h2>主要特性</h2><ul>\n<li>完全可定制的飞行平视显示器（<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/HUD\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>）<ul>\n<li>实时显示飞行数据的资讯界面\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/img/hud/full_screenshot_alt.png\"></li></ul></li>\n<li>智能飞行安全警报（<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/Alerts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>）<ul>\n<li>在危险发生前及时感知不安全的飞行状况\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/img/hud/alert_display_alt.png\"></li></ul></li>\n<li>无干扰自动飞行保护（<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/Flight-protections\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>）<ul>\n<li>当您分心时，FlightAssistant 将为您提供保护</li>\n<li>例如：地面碰撞伤害规避、虚空伤害规避、自动鞘翅展开</li></ul></li>\n<li>具备飞行规划能力的高级自动驾驶：完全解放双手安全飞行（<a href=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/Autopilot:-overview-and-basics\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">维基</a>）<ul>\n<li>飞行计划可保存至磁盘并在后续加载</li>\n<li>通过飞行计划，可实现从起飞到降落的全程自动化飞行\n<img src=\"https://github.com/Octol1ttle/FlightAssistant/wiki/img/hud/full_screenshot.png\"></li></ul></li>\n</ul>",
